# Code owners for privileged paths (Issue #2606).
#
# The main ruleset (infra/rulesets/main.json) sets require_code_owner_review,
# so a PR touching any path below cannot merge until a listed owner approves.
# Owners are the human repository admins only: the worker bot identities
# (stservice, VibeCoderST) are deliberately absent, so the fleet can never
# satisfy code-owner review on its own changes to CI or ruleset config.
# Every other path has no owner and merges through the normal gate.
#
# Last matching pattern wins. Guarded by worker/deno/tests/codeowners_test.ts.

# Workflows, composite actions, CI scripts and scanner config — every
# change here can alter what runs with repository credentials.
/.github/                @nleck @Green-Beret

# Branch ruleset definitions — the merge policy itself.
/infra/rulesets/         @nleck @Green-Beret
